{"cells": [{"cell_type": "markdown", "source": ["## Algorithm: linear search (pseudocode)\n", "\n", "```pseudocode\n", "FUNCTION find(xs, t)\n", "  FOR i FROM 0 TO length of xs - 1\n", "    IF xs[i] = t THEN\n", "      RETURN i\n", "    END IF\n", "  END FOR\n", "  RETURN -1\n", "END FUNCTION\n", "EXAMPLE find([5, 7, 9], 9) -> 2\n", "```\n"]}, {"cell_type": "code", "source": ["print('hello')\n"]}, {"cell_type": "markdown", "source": ["Just prose here."]}], "metadata": {}, "nbformat": 4, "nbformat_minor": 5}